WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,140
I, Su Weiwei, will put my words here today.

2
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,460
I'm just starving to death

3
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:15,660
Jump off this mountain

4
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,460
I will never eat anything from Dalinfeng

5
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,520
They didn’t say they would give it to you either.

6
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:22,550
Swearing people is not enough

7
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:27,390
Weiwei, don’t say angry words and listen to my advice. Come and make me angry too.

8
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:28,310
Not angry with you

9
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:29,470
Yan is in Jiang Yue's hands

10
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:31,630
Food is getting less and less for more than a dozen of us every day.

11
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:32,550
Live life with your fingers crossed

12
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:33,750
I can't last more than a few days like this.

13
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:34,830
What do you think we should do?

14
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,750
Go and beg him Lin Feng

15
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:36,670
Not begging

16
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,390
It’s about fair cooperation

17
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:40,070
He has so much stuff there that he can't even put it down.

18
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,230
We have people

19
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,550
Send someone over to do the work

20
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:44,110
Exchange salt for food

21
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:50,220
Everyone is happy to cooperate with you, Sister Yao

22
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,820
You want me to send people to his cave?

23
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,380
You forgot who said that that day

24
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,620
If you want to treat him like shit, I admit it.

25
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:57,740
What I said was wrong at that time

26
00:00:58,220 --> 00:00:59,780
Now there is only one rule on the island

27
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:02,500
Only those who are valuable are qualified to talk to Weiwei.

28
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,500
you are the leader

29
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:05,620
Think about which end is lighter and which is heavier

30
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:07,260
Well, you go and talk

31
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:08,740
But people must be able to come back

32
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:10,540
Only if you dare to detain someone, the matter will be over.

33
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:12,380
Okay, I'll go there early tomorrow morning

34
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:14,940
What will be released this time?
